    "1. 点「打开系统设置」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Click “Open System Settings”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 点列表下方的 ＋，在「应用程序」里选择 FreeFileSync": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Click ＋ below the list and choose FreeFileSync in Applications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 打开 FreeFileSync 旁边的开关，然后回到这里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Turn on the switch next to FreeFileSync, then come back here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FreeFileSync": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "FreeFileSync 是免费开源的同步工具，SyncDock 用它来执行同步。下载后打开安装包，按提示安装即可。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FreeFileSync is a free, open-source sync tool that SyncDock uses to do the syncing. Download it, open the installer and follow the steps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FreeFileSync 没有完全磁盘访问权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FreeFileSync doesn’t have Full Disk Access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SyncDock 借助 FreeFileSync 在后台同步文件。开始之前，先完成下面两步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SyncDock syncs your folders in the background using FreeFileSync. Before you start, complete the two steps below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次 %@（每周）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next: %@ (weekly)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
