    "只删除这个同步任务和它的定时设置（会移到废纸篓），已经同步过去的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the task and its schedule are deleted (moved to the Trash). Files that were already synced stay where they are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在你点菜单栏里的 ▶ 时同步一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syncs once each time you click ▶ in the menu bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步任务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync Task"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步到：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syncs to: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步方式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync Method"
