    "让目标和源完全一致：源里删掉的文件，目标里也会删掉（移到废纸篓或云端回收站）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Makes the destination identical to the source: files deleted from the source are also deleted from the destination (moved to the Trash or the cloud recycle bin)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
